# Repo-root build context (apps/web/Dockerfile). The deploy script already stages a clean
# `git archive` context; this file keeps an ad-hoc `docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .`
# from uploading GBs of local state.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.pnpm-cache
**/.vercel
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.copilot-tmp
external
infra
server
apps/*
!apps/web
apps/web/public/samples
apps/web/data
apps/web/learn-content
apps/web/public/sw*
apps/web/public/globals.css
